      "position": [-200, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-OPS-01: System Health Aggregator\n\n**Schedule:** Every 5 minutes during market hours (9:30 AM - 4 PM ET weekdays)\n\n**Purpose:** Comprehensive system health monitoring with composite scoring\n\n### Health Components & Weights:\n- SwjshAK API: 25%\n- Database: 20%\n- Trading Agents: 20%\n- OpenClaw Gateway: 15%\n- Alpaca Broker: 10%\n- n8n Instance: 10%\n\n### Alert Thresholds:\n- Score < 50: CRITICAL (P1) - Discord alert + PULSE ticket + auto-recovery\n- Score < 80: DEGRADED (P2) - PULSE ticket created\n- Hourly: Summary posted to #system\n\n### Trend Tracking:\n- Compares last hour of metrics\n- Alerts on degradation trend (>10 point drop)"
      }
    },
