      "id": "sticky-scoring",
      "name": "Note: Health Scoring",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1200, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Composite Health Score\n\n**Formula:** Weighted average of component scores\n\n**Component Scoring:**\n- Healthy: 100 points\n- Degraded: Partial (e.g., agents: running/total * 100)\n- Unhealthy: 0 points\n\n**Status Thresholds:**\n- >= 80%: Healthy (green)\n- 50-79%: Degraded (yellow)\n- < 50%: Critical (red)\n\n**Auto-Recovery:**\nTriggered for crashed agents and failed services when score < 50%"
      }
    }
